# 9. Agent Checklist Before Finishing

1. Draft lesson text.
2. Tag each section: math-pattern or real-world-story.
3. Search and embed 2–4 verified URLs (HTTP 200).
4. Confirm no nature/decorative image stands in for a math rule.
5. Keep or add local `img/chapter_img/` SVG where the repo already has them.
6. Add/keep one JavaScript interactive.
7. Run `python3 scripts/check_vi_interactive_coverage.py` for Vietnamese posts.
8. Run `JEKYLL_ENV=production bundle exec jekyll build --baseurl "/math-lover"`.